  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `waterlines: bool` (default `true`) across `Finish3DParams`, `OpParams::Finish3D`, `ParamsDto::Finish3D`, MCP tools (`add_operation`, `edit_operation`, `list_operation_types`), project serialization (`#[serde(default = \"default_true\")]`), and the 3D Finish Passes UI tab (`Steep flanks`: `Waterlines` / `Leave uncut` with an inline consequence note).\n- Updated `rings_and_tail_with_trim` and `swarf_multi` so `waterlines: false` skips the steep-flank waterline ring pass on shallow-first patterns, emits a visible steep-flank note on `Toolpath::notes` (surfaced in the UI status banner and MCP output), keeps uncut steep-flank stock visible to downstream rest checks, and refuses all-steep or no-shallow-cut models with `GenError::Empty`.\n- Refused `waterlines: false` by name for ring-dependent patterns (`Waterline`, `Blend`, `Morph`), and hid the switch in the UI for patterns without a steep-flank waterline pass (`Waterline`, `Blend`, `Morph`, `Flat`, `Pencil`, `Corner`, `Geodesic`).\n- Addressed all review items:\n  - Pattern switch to `Waterline`, `Blend`, or `Morph` resets `*waterlines = true`, and the `Steep flanks` row stays visible whenever `!*waterlines` so users are never stranded on a refused value; stacked `Waterlines` and `Leave uncut` vertically inside `prop_row` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill3d_page.rs` (378 lines) so radios do not overlap the `\"Steep flanks\"` label, pinned by `finish3d_waterlines_pattern_switch_resets_and_stays_visible_when_off`.\n  - Added direct stamp test `finish3d_waterlines_flag_changes_op_stamp_directly` in `crates/app/tests/operations.rs` comparing `operation::op_stamp` between `waterlines: true` and `waterlines: false` (`0x4E`).\n  - Added `1280x1180` before/after Passes tab screenshots on orphan fork branch `pr-screenshots/3550`.\n- Merged `upstream/main` cleanly keeping `direction_angle`, `pass_start`, `Finish3D` Do not touch, and `waterlines` together, and recorded design decisions in `docs/decisions/2811-finish-waterlines-switch.md`.\n\n## Screenshots (before / after, Passes tab at `1280x1180`)\n\n| State | Screenshot |\n|---|---|\n| Before change | ![Passes tab before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulsvc/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3550/finish3d-passes-before.png) |\n| After (`Leave uncut` selected + consequence line) | ![Passes tab after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paulsvc/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/3550/finish3d-passes-after.png) |\n\n## Verification\n\nVerified via separate `gate-runner` under `PROCESS_VERSION 140` (#3556):\n\n- Head `cb5e2c4fefca323bdbc7bab4aaca203c988bdc63` (differs from `b16439561` only in adding `waterlines: true` to test file `crates/motion/tests/rotary_coverage.rs`):\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-motion --test rotary_coverage --test finish3d_waterlines`: `finish3d_waterlines` 5 passed, `rotary_coverage` 4 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --test operations --test example_catalog --test mcp_doc_drift --test project_roundtrip`: `operations` 124 passed (6 ignored), `example_catalog` 39 passed (4 ignored), `mcp_doc_drift` 6 passed, `project_roundtrip` 82 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-ui --lib finish3d_waterlines -- --test-threads=1`: 2 passed, 0 failed (`finish3d_waterlines_pattern_switch_resets_and_stays_visible_when_off` and `finish3d_waterlines_radio_consequence_apply_undo_and_status_note`).\n  - `cargo clippy -j 10 -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n  - `cargo xtask gate light` (`CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1`, `CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=10`): passed (3 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled; wall 0.4 min).\n- Full touched suite run on `b164395614535c82f2796c7673e8bffc46a8a2af` (same non-test code):\n  - `camcraft-motion` (9 targets): `lib` 576 (10 ignored), `finish3d` 55 (33 ignored), `finish3d_gaplink` 7 (1 ignored), `finish3d_holes` 5, `finish3d_hop_height` 3, `finish3d_land` 7, `finish3d_overhang_and_chord` 3, `finish3d_pass_start` 3, `finish3d_waterlines` 5 (0 failed).\n  - `camcraft-app` (24 targets): `lib` 303, `area_controls` 13, `catalog_groove_part_off` 1, `continuous_4axis_part` 10, `do_not_touch_finish3d` 5, `example_catalog` 39 (4 ignored), `example_catalog_adaptive` 1, `example_catalog_edge_work` 1, `finish3d_direction` 4, `finish3d_pass_start` 3, `first_4axis_part` 4, `first_part_programs` 2, `first_router_part` 4, `golden_cl` 34, `import_step_q02_mold` 1 (1 ignored), `mcp` 30, `mcp_doc_drift` 6, `operations` 124 (6 ignored), `posed_contact` 5, `project_roundtrip` 82, `setup_align_3d` 6, `tilt_basis_compat` 7, `verify` 21 (2 ignored), `wcs_start` 6 (0 failed).\n  - `camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: 1525 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored (including all 4 `guide_projects::*` tests).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main`: clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Interactive desktop click session (exercised via `egui_kittest` renders and assertions).\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: Added a Waterlines switch to 3D Finish operations to skip steep-flank ring passes with a visible uncut-flank warning and all-steep refusal.\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #2811\n",
